re not going to make it right if  you're not getting engagement if people  aren't watching your video it doesn't  matter how much keyword optimization you  have you're not gonna get your video  ranked  it reminds me of of the uh the older  days of seo right you you create a  website you create a page you just stuff  it with all the keywords all the  different tools and techniques and  tricks to get ranked and then people  will come to your site  but  if it's a piece of junk content they're  not going to take action they're not  going to buy anything from you and  google is starting to down rank those  and they want the content that people  actually pay attention to  so it's happening in youtube as well  less and less importance on what you tag  it and what description you use and if  you caption it or not and what the title  is  and more are people actually paying  attention to this are they watching it  are they liking it are they leaving  comments are they sharing it are they  embedding it and if you want that to  happen you have to create epic stuff  great stuff that is worth sharing  so if you had an hour a day to spend on  this i'd say spend that hour  forgetting about your research forget  about what keywords to use and just  create great stuff  belief  for those of you watching if you thought  this video is great if you like the  channel  please give this video a thumbs up below  let me know what you think you have a  question just like alex did you i'm  gonna answer for you leave it in the  comment section and if you liked the  video you want to see more subscribe to  the channel see you soon  believe and thank you for watching  you
 

